        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.8.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 8.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kaji iyie inkuna pee itusulunye te keper iyie lo Akira le Nkakenya, enkerai Enkakenya! Ng'ura ajo kitudung'oki aapudaki enkop, iyie olapa oitadowuo iloreren kop! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.11.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 11.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.10.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 10.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Itejo apa iyie to ltau lino, ‘Kailep alo keper; te idia alo ilakir le Nkai kapik olorika lai le nkitoo shumata oleng; katon nanu to ldoinyo le umata te nelakua te nkalo e moikuape; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kailep nanu alo te idia alo nkatampo, kaitotiu nanu kewan anaa Ilo Otii Shumata aisul.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake kintadouoki aayau enemeneng'a, nenen neegut e nemenenga eululu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo likidol iyie nikishumaki nkonyek, nikiimaki iyie, ejo: ‘Kele tung'ani apa oikirikirie enkop, neigusugusie nkitoriat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oitaa enkop olpurkel neibelekeny nkanas enyena, neitu eisho lelo ooena meshomo ang?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo aiguanak pooki loo loreren neirrag te nkitoo, olaiguanani ake ti atua enkurare enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake kitanang'ayioki iyie aaiturraa, aaitalam enkurare ino, anaa enkaitubului nemeyieuni, neitemori too mpopoki e lelo ootuata, te lelo ootaaraki to lalem, lelo oosulakino isoito le ululu, anaa empopok naitunyi too nkejek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikinukari iyie aaitaboitaki ninche enkaraki nindaikie enkop ino, itara iyie iltung'ana linono metuata. Ore eishoi e lelo aasak loo ntorrok, nchoo eaku meigili ai kata aaipot!. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entobira esesekuanata oo layiok lenyena te nkaraki entorroni oo loo menye, pee mebul ake neibung enkop, neiput oriong enkop nkanas.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keidaikie Olaitoriani Babilon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kadumunye nanu aitayunye ninche olarrabal,” Olaitoriani loo lororani ojo, “naa kaiwuang'ie nanu te Babilon enkarna o lpisiai, olmarei, Olaitoriani ojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitaa nanu ina kop emanyisho oo lkirrumun, naitaa ilturot le nkare, naa kaor nanu te oret e nkidaata, Olaitoriani loo lororani ojo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keidaikie Olaitoriani ile Asiria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
