        },
        {
          "text": " Einosa Olaitoriani loo lororani olmumai: “Ore anaa enaitobira nanu, neijia elo atiu, naa ore anaa enatudung'o, neijia etiu keunoyu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchere kalo nanu agil ilo le Asiria ti atua enkop ai, ore te shumata lelo doinyo laainei naitunyoki nanu ninye enkop too nkejek; ore ina shata enye oo murto neiwuang'a te ninche, o ilo ola lenye otii oloililai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena ninye ina yieunoto natuutuaki eipirta enkop pooki; naa ena ninye ina aina naitorioyioki te shumata iloshon pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etuutua Olaitoriani loo lororani, naa aing'ae oiwuang'ie ina? Eitorioyioki enkaina enye, naa aing'ae oshuk?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
