        },
        {
          "text": " “Ming'ida iyie Filistia, o intae pooki, eji nchere, etigile ina ng'udi apa natoosho intae; amu te eishoi o lasurai epuku olasurai torrono aisul, ore olng'anayioi lenye naa olasurai olo tiaai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo kikau lo laisinani nedaa, ore ilo oata osina neirrag te seriani; kake kamut nanu entonai eishoi ino to lameyu, ore ilo pisiai lino naar nanu to lalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teyietu, na kishomi; nchira, na anasa; talepori to lkirutoto, iyie Filistia, intae pooki! Amu kelotu empuruo eimu moikuape, nemeetae oloisiadu to ltim lenye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo ewaliki oltung'ani olkilikuai loo loshon? “Olaitoriani oitobirua Sion, naa ore ti atua ninye netum lelo tung'ana lenyena apa ooisilisiloki esarunoto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.32"
            ]
